  m_text: '(Darling, hold my hand)


    Nothing beats a Jet2holiday

    And right
    now, you can save fifty pounds per person. That''s two hundred pounds off for
    a family of four. We''ve got millions of free child place holidays available.
    With twenty-two kilograms of baggage included.


    Book now with Jet2holidays.
    Package holidays you can trust!'
